    "Name": "Praetorian",
    "Details": "The original variant of the Praetorian is also the most deadly in pure damage output. The design carries a massive Railgun, an almost equally large Naval Laser, an arm-mounted LBX AC/10 and finally two ER Large Lasers. All these weapons mean that damage can still be consistently delivered over most ranges, but due to the quite bad cooling they are not meant to all be fired at the same time..\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Superheavy Prototype</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>",
